msgid ""
"[Data sharing resources of the McGill "
"library](https://www.mcgill.ca/libraries/research-services/data-"
"services/sharing)"
msgstr ""
"[Ressources de partage de données de la bibliothèque de "
"McGill](https://www.mcgill.ca/libraries/research-services/data-"
"services/sharing)"

